# Noizu cluster port-forward catalog
# Format (whitespace-separated):
#   name  namespace  service  remote_port  local_port  profiles  [bind_ip]  [bind_port]
#
# local_port  = high port on 127.0.0.1 (always registered; used by Caddy Pattern A)
# bind_ip     = optional lo0 alias (Pattern B); when set, also PF --address bind_ip:bind_port
# bind_port   = port on bind_ip (default: remote_port for DBs, 80 for HTTP)
#
# Profiles: data, platform, infra, ai, apps, minio, all

# --- Data tiers (Timescale / Valkey) ---
# local high-ports for Caddy/tools; bind_ip:standard ports for app env (host=app-tsdb.dev port=5432)
app-tsdb        apps      svc/app-timescaledb        5432   54330   data,apps,all       10.0.0.10  5432
app-valkey      apps      svc/app-valkey              6379   56379   data,apps,all       10.0.0.11  6379
platform-tsdb   platform  svc/platform-timescaledb   5432   54320   data,platform,all   10.0.0.12  5432
platform-valkey platform  svc/platform-valkey        6379   56380   data,platform,all   10.0.0.13  6379
infra-tsdb      infra     svc/infra-timescaledb      5432   54310   data,infra,all      10.0.0.14  5432
infra-valkey    infra     svc/infra-valkey           6379   56381   data,infra,all      10.0.0.15  6379

# --- Infra / secrets / TF state ---
minio           infra     svc/minio-service          9000   9000    infra,minio,all     10.0.0.20  9000
minio-console   infra     svc/minio-service          9001   9001    infra,minio,all     10.0.0.21  9001
infisical       infra     svc/infisical              80     18080   infra,all           10.0.0.22  80

