weaviate-grpc   platform-ai  svc/weaviate-grpc       50051  50051   ai,all              10.0.0.42  50051
qdrant          platform-ai  svc/qdrant              6333   16333   ai,all              10.0.0.43  6333
qdrant-grpc     platform-ai  svc/qdrant              6334   16334   ai,all              10.0.0.44  6334

